<< /BS << /W 0 >> /F 4 /FT /Btn /Ff 65536 /MK << /BC [ 0 0 0 0 ] >> /P 223 0 R /Rect [ 56.696999 174.644992 538.617004 745.845004 ] /Subtype /Widget /T (Figure1) /TU (Flowchart illustrating a machine learning model architecture for spatiotemporal feature extraction and classification. It includes modules for temporal multi-scale feature extraction, frequency-domain feature extraction, spatiotemporal feature adaptive fusion, and classifier. Key components like MSST-Mamba, RMSNorm, and MambaBlock are highlighted, with operations such as linear processing, graph convolution networks \(GCNs\), and multi-scale spatial prior enhancement. The diagram uses various symbols like circles for operations \(e.g., integration, activation\) and connects different layers to show data flow.) /Type /Annot >>
endobj
