703 0 obj
<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Flowchart illustrating a machine learning model architecture for spatiotemporal feature extraction and classification. It includes modules for temporal multi-scale feature extraction, frequency-domain feature extraction, spatiotemporal feature adaptive fusion, and classifier. Key components like MSST-Mamba, RMSNorm, and MambaBlock are highlighted, with operations such as linear processing, graph convolution networks \(GCNs\), and multi-scale spatial prior enhancement. The diagram uses various symbols like circles for operations \(e.g., integration, activation\) and connects different layers to show data flow.) /K 763 0 R /P 237 0 R /Pg 223 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
704 0 obj
<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (A diagram illustrating a process for EEG data analysis. It involves three main stages: raw EEG input and Level-1 segmentation, multi-scale Level-2 segmentation using sliding windows, and rPSD feature extraction with tensor generation. The raw EEG data is divided into coarse segments and further into sub-segments. Each sub-segment undergoes FFT and rPSD for seven bands, producing a multi-scale feature tensor. Multiple colored arrows indicate data flow through each step.) /K 764 0 R /P 237 0 R /Pg 224 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
705 0 obj
<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Illustration of two EEG setups: 62-channel EEG on the left with densely packed electrodes in various colors labeled with positions such as F7, C3, and Pz, and a 32-channel EEG on the right with fewer electrodes labeled similarly.) /K 765 0 R /P 237 0 R /Pg 226 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
endobj
706 0 obj
<< /A << /O /Layout /Placement /Block >> /Alt (Three graphs \(a, b, c\) compare Accuracy and F1 Score. \n\nGraph a: Depicts PSD, DE, and rPSD methods. Accuracy rises from 72.16% to 85.03%, and F1 Score increases from 68.34% to 83.43%.\n\nGraph b: Shows performance over various MSST blocks. Accuracy fluctuates between 85.03% and 79.77%, with F1 Score between 83.43% and 82.12%.\n\nGraph c: Evaluates regions. Accuracy drops from 85.03% to 82.28%, and F1 Score decreases from 83.43% to 81.27%.) /K 766 0 R /P 237 0 R /Pg 230 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
